    "description": "Postman collection for the routes mounted in src/app.ts.\n\nRegister or Login saves token, username, and userUuid. Admin Login saves adminToken. Create Story saves storySlug, storyUuid, and storyIdentifier. Add Comment saves commentId.\n\nBodies include every accepted field, including optional ones, with sample values. Remove a query param when you do not want that filter.\n\nStory status: draft, submitted, approved, rejected, published.\nStory visibility: public, followers_only.\nStory identifiers accept a slug, story UUID, or numeric id.\nUsernames may contain letters, numbers, underscores, hyphens, and periods.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
